  "description": "RFC 9111 HTTP caching and request coalescing for the .NET HttpClient pipeline. Deduplicates concurrent requests, prevents cache stampedes, and adds ETag/Last-Modified revalidation, stale-while-revalidate and stale-if-error (RFC 5861), and distributed cache support — composable DelegatingHandlers that slot in alongside Polly.",
